Enumeration RecognitionType
    documentation 'The nature of recognition given to the student for accomplishments in a 
                  'co-curricular, or extra-curricular activity.
    item Athletic awards
    item Awarding of units of value
    item Citizenship award/recognition
    item Completion of requirement, but no units of value awarded
    item Certificate
    item Honor award
    item Letter of commendation
    item Medals
    item Monogram/letter
    item Points
    item Promotion or advancement
    item Other